4SjSR910T_8xvt4wmevitpTdrLstfF0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGuRk7B91iNMjvGa6Sa1bTLMo2DD5wKnVqwwsadcqlvZg&oe=6A974832"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot(1)_2560_1440.png", "id": "2100665936973153", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982680_2100665940306486_5664456920141678252_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N_j8rK1wpDEQ7kNvwE8-HRT&_nc_oc=AdpKu5G0JJUMkYhkO8kiTPU5FZ49Zpfyvr0QIc75OC4gvPJEY8zohErVHBxHDvtGiQ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEasD09xvnbNewtMThF5XXxu3mzjCtSzWbqPqJXy-aVQg&oe=6A973557"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image.png", "id": "368600119311127", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_368600122644460_5598028405797075028_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RXyzU5cYbfEQ7kNvwHAuqpi&_nc_oc=AdrIHMKobZeglEcX_4mpOibaUQ2749qJbHJa9tsFBKhqkAhhUtAOTlv8_q1O8NqRzbo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEvYwrk0mfHm52mrcSeDlNFmchqAHszi95BHCUoLFo9cw&oe=6A973A95"}, "display_name": "2035 Carbon neutrality of smart green city", "keywords": [], "long_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths.\n\n1. Experience goal\n- Discover specific career topics in promising future industries and occupations against the backdrop of a smart green city in 2035\n- Explore a future path by experiencing a space for carbon neutrality\n- Learn about the need for carbon neutrality and what young people can do\n- Learn about core underlying technologies such as realistic content technology provided as an experience\n\n2. Characteristics of content\n- First-person perspective in which the experiencer becomes the main character\n- 7-step composition according to the actual experience process\n- Developed based on standing only\n- Movement and manipulation using the Oculus Controller\n- Estimated experience time of about 20 to 30 minutes\n\n3. 7-step configuration\nSTEP 1 Instructions on how to operate\nSTEP 2 Meeting with the UN Youth Delegation\nSTEP 3 Practicing carbon neutrality in urban forests\nSTEP 4 Implementation of carbon neutrality in wind power plants\nSTEP 5 Carbon neutrality practice at the East Coast carbon storage site\nSTEP 6 Think\nSTEP 7 Finishing\n", "short_description": "It is a VR content that allows teenagers to experience a space for carbon neutrality, learn about the need for carbon neutrality, what they can do, and explore future career paths."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover_3000x900.png", "id": "7527653000591853", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001730_7527653007258519_8435369833685824333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BOpOrc9RidcQ7kNvwFE4bvd&_nc_oc=AdqdkIRij2SNqDuwpecxCzePILxQI2wU7eTvdk_Gqro8gsj4cLS0nsOUPXv273tj2ZU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHJU64CpB2acG9r9tUho2bZAGNtwX8YW0iXq7ImHV1vqw&oe=6A974E42"}, {"file_name": "Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1452940842279363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031355_1452940845612696_1891464877969558457_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DMygUwpA4AYQ7kNvwEVDSU6&_nc_oc=AdpyD7Bm35ZeFkkGa4yCui6oqQ7kNRweHjPj5TRw_wZj50K2GoPgswsjgE_9N0AE514&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHVb-BfDxfC5Es5KCbfKUQ_csfmIcMs0aLE3Qp43m5b4g&oe=6A9734C4"}, {"file_name": "Portrait_1008x1440.png", "id": "959181839136200", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566686_959181842469533_2388841801262298119_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=30xxYHN5ApkQ7kNvwGz_Ggt&_nc_oc=AdqWuoYGI66N1KDz9fERZwE8teoHzRe3A8arZWFXA1yTr96J7UzGVw1erLsuuQl